ConditionMet_Escrow_Unit_Concrete_Test
├── when the condition is invoice amount reached
│   ├── when the escrow holds at least the amount
│   │   └── it should return true
│   └── when it holds less
│       └── it should return false
└── when the condition is payee claimed
    ├── when the payee has no code
    │   └── it should return false
    ├── when isOwner of Companies House reverts
    │   └── it should return false
    ├── when isOwner returns fewer or more than 32 bytes
    │   └── it should return false
    ├── when isOwner returns a word that is neither 0 nor 1
    │   └── it should return false
    ├── when Companies House is the payee's only owner
    │   └── it should return false
    ├── when Companies House is one of several owners
    │   └── it should return false
    ├── when the payee has one owner who is not Companies House
    │   └── it should return true
    └── when the payee has two owners and neither is Companies House
        └── it should return true
